  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "<p>Concordia University, St. Paul, is a private institution offering over 100 degree options in various disciplines. Founded in 1893, the Universityâ€™s mission is to â€œwelcome all as we honour Christâ€_x009d_, but people of all faiths are welcome to pursue their academic goals at the institution.</p><p>Around 157 international students from countries worldwide enrol on courses at the University every year.</p><h2>What is the Concordia University acceptance rate for International Students?</h2><p>The acceptance rate for Concordia University St. Paul is 68%. </p><p>Students can enjoy the services of an academic advisor to help them with issues such as transfer credits, course selection, faculty concerns and more. The bookstore has a variety of services and products available, from new book releases to computers and hardware. There are four main campus ministry areas for students to practise their faith and an Office of Career Development to help students start their future careers. There is also a Diversity Centre and Library Technology Centre on its scenic campus.  Concordia provides a fully equipped fitness centre, basketball and volleyball courts, and an indoor track.</p><p><strong>Student Life</strong></p> </p> <p>Concordia University, St. Paul, provides International Student Services so students can succeed to their fullest potential with holistic assistance. There are over 35 student clubs run by fellow peers and more than 250 club events designed to provide entertainment on campus. The University also regularly arranges sports tournaments, movie nights, and community service projects.</p> "
